      en: ["The name means 'Market of Bahauddin', named after a local Sufi saint.", "Located in the Chaj Doab between the Jhelum and Chenab rivers.", "Became an independent district in 1993.", "Population is around 198,000 according to the 2017 census.", "A prominent center for the processing and sale of prime quality Kinnow (mandarin).", "Situated near the historical site of the Battle of the Hydaspes (326 BC)."],
